 and PC expanded version of the original Dreamcast game, is actually a port with both the game released first for Xbox 360 and PlayStation 3 under the title of \"Sonic Adventure\" and its DLC, \"Sonic Adventure DX Upgrade\". These two contents are enhanced ports of the PC version of the original \"Sonic Adventure DX: Director's Cut\".", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sonic-adventure-dx-directors-cut--1", "videos": [{"id": 163192, "name": "Director's Commentary", "video_id": "AU-EWZV-EZ4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AU-EWZV-EZ4", "title": "Sonic Adventure DX - Director's Commentary (2004)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AU-EWZV-EZ4/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 6172, "name": "Sonic Adventure"}, {"id": 2156, "name": "Sonic the Hedgehog"}]}